# Migration script outputs — regenerated by migration/scripts/* on each run.
# README.md and migration-plan.md are tracked; the rest are generated.
# ci-backup-*.yml + migration-log.md + snapshot-*.txt are TRACKED when present
# (they're audit-trail artifacts the apply / rollback steps depend on).
prompts/ralph-meta-chain/migration/inventory-report.md
prompts/ralph-meta-chain/migration/file-classification.md
prompts/ralph-meta-chain/migration/proposed-moves.md
prompts/ralph-meta-chain/migration/rollback-plan.md
prompts/ralph-meta-chain/migration/conflicts.md

# Experiment runtime artifacts (Round 7) — auto-generated.
# .gitkeep + the README in each directory are tracked; everything else
# is volatile.
prompts/ralph-meta-chain/experiments/outputs/*
!prompts/ralph-meta-chain/experiments/outputs/.gitkeep
prompts/ralph-meta-chain/experiments/reports/report-*.md
